      "(10) I Must Go",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi sees Gao Ming again. She is very happy.",
      "",
      "Gao Ming says, “Senior, I saw the cats at the small restaurant. How about we go together to see them?”",
      "",
      "“Sure. Let’s go,” Leng Xiaoxi says.",
      "",
      "Senior? He called me senior? How did he know I’m his senior?",
      "",
      "“How did you know …” Leng Xiaoxi wants to ask.",
      "",
      "At this time, someone rings Leng Xiaoxi. Leng Xiaoxi looks at her phone. It is Doctor Xie from the hospital.",
      "Doctor Xie says someone dialed 120. The hospital needs three doctors. He hopes Leng Xiaoxi will come back to work.",
      "",
      "Leng Xiaoxi must return to the hospital. She looks at Gao Ming and says, “Sorry, I must go.”",
      "",
      "“Now? Right now? Will we … will we see each other again?” Gao Ming asks."
    ]
